# issue: none
# notes: query-fuzz repro `count-block-filter-only-hand` (query-fuzz/README.md); the edition-2 text, expectations blessed from EDITION-2

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Tag { count: I32? }

--- seed
{"type":"Tag","id":"t1","data":{"count":3}}
{"type":"Tag","id":"t2","data":{"count":1}}

--- query
query q() {
  match {
    $t: Tag
    count { $t.count > 2 } != 0
  }
  return { $t.@id }
}

--- expect unordered
{"t.@id": "t1"}

--- expect shape
t.@id: String
